; Subject 2, intent 4. Unlike subject 1 this one probed for candidates first, so
; it is WEAKER evidence of convergence — it may have read the target's law before
; stating its own. Committed so the two can be told apart rather than pooled.
(defn wanted [] [(s Str)] Str s
  (prop never-contains-a-tab [(x0 Str)]
    (not (contains 9 (str-bytes (wanted x0))))))
